From: Simon McVittie <smcv@debian.org>
Date: Mon, 10 Jan 2022 12:04:40 +0000
Subject: Remove FUSE performance flags no longer supported with FUSE 3

With FUSE 3, most optional features are on by default and these options
no longer exist.

Signed-off-by: Simon McVittie <smcv@debian.org>
---
 src/builder-context.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/builder-context.c b/src/builder-context.c
index 5fbfac3..80ae6d6 100644
--- a/src/builder-context.c
+++ b/src/builder-context.c
@@ -828,7 +828,7 @@ builder_context_enable_rofiles (BuilderContext *self,
   g_autofree char *tmpdir_name = NULL;
   char *argv[] = { "rofiles-fuse",
                    "-o",
-                   "kernel_cache,entry_timeout=60,attr_timeout=60,splice_write,splice_move",
+                   "kernel_cache,entry_timeout=60,attr_timeout=60",
                    (char *)flatpak_file_get_path_cached (self->app_dir),
                    NULL,
                    NULL };
